      },
      "text": "Mexico City: historic centre and museum"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d637f301b05867c409cfd563bdd3f2a8a0ff570528d805a6af69f9c1ebf226ae",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6lzct9-a8m9x2yez",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Tour Mexico City with an English-speaking guide, taking in the Zócalo, the Metropolitan Cathedral, Templo Mayor, Chapultepec and the anthropology museum. You’ll visit the National Palace, home to Diego Rivera’s murals, only if it is open to visitors. Overnight in Mexico City."
